<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>What Large-Scale System Will Your Structure-Revealing AI Control?</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/output.css">
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen bg-slate-950 text-slate-100">
    <%- include("../backButton") %>

    <main class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-8 sm:px-8 sm:py-12">
        <header class="mb-10">
            <p class="mb-2 text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-400">
                Structural Intelligence
            </p>

            <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">
                What large-scale system will your structure-revealing AI control?
            </h1>

            <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-slate-300">
                Choose where the AI will apply its understanding of deep systemic patterns.
            </p>
        </header>

        <ul class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <li>
                <a
                    href="/governance"
                    class="block h-full rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 p-5 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-indigo-400 hover:bg-slate-800 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-400"
                >
                    <strong class="block text-lg text-white">
                        1. Governance
                    </strong>

                    <span class="mt-2 block text-sm text-slate-300">
                        Take charge of governing institutions or territories. Use discovered latent variables and deep regularities to redesign policy, detect systemic failure modes early, and keep the entire system coherent over long timescales.
                    </span>
                </a>
            </li>

            <li>
                <a
                    href="/economy"
                    class="block h-full rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 p-5 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-indigo-400 hover:bg-slate-800 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-400"
                >
                    <strong class="block text-lg text-white">
                        2. Economic Management
                    </strong>

                    <span class="mt-2 block text-sm text-slate-300">
                        Direct the operation of large economic systems. Continuously surface the hidden mechanisms that drive markets, production, and allocation, then act on those mechanisms rather than on surface indicators.
                    </span>
                </a>
            </li>

            <li>
                <a
                    href="/firm"
                    class="block h-full rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 p-5 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-indigo-400 hover:bg-slate-800 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-400"
                >
                    <strong class="block text-lg text-white">
                        3. Private Firm
                    </strong>

                    <span class="mt-2 block text-sm text-slate-300">
                        Run a company as a single coherent system. Identify the true generative drivers of value, risk, and organization inside the firm and align every decision to those deeper patterns.
                    </span>
                </a>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
